steps.text:
Open the sensor's web page (Tasmota: Configuration → Configure MQTT) and enter:

Host: {mqtt_host}
Port: {mqtt_port}
User: {mqtt_user}
Password: {secret.mqtt_password}
Topic: {topic}

Save. Then, in its Console, type DeepSleepTime 300 (it then wakes every 5 minutes to report). Tap Next while it's awake.
